{title: I Came To Praise The Lord}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]I Don't Know  What You Came To Do
But I Came  To Praise The Lord
[C]I Don't Know  What You Came To Do
But I Came  To [Am]Praise The [G]Lord
I Don't Know  What You Came To Do
But I Came  To Praise The [Em]Lord
